; GaiaLabs Retranslation, chapter 15. Dialogue only.

?INCLUDE 'fr39_erik'
fr39_erik.dialogstring_05CB93! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: We're all together[N]again, but I can't even[N]cry from happiness.[WAI][N]I guess I've run out of[N]tears[AD][END]`

?INCLUDE 'fr39_lance'
fr39_lance.dialogstring_05C85E! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4][DLY:2]Lance: Where is this…?[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][DLY:2]Kara: It feels strangely[N]familiar…[FIN][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3][DLY:2]Erik: I feel as if I'm in[N]my mom's tummy…[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2][DLY:2]Lilly: Every person I've[N]met, every day I've lived…[N]It's all rising in my mind[N]at once.[FIN][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4][DLY:2][DLY:2]Lance: I grew up in South[N]Cape. Then my old man[N]left on that expedition[N]and never came back.[FIN]He was such a big part of[N]my life. When he vanished,[N]I didn't know what to do.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][DLY:2]Kara: I hated watching my[N]father invade other lands.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][DLY:2]People spend years[N]building a life… and[N]soldiers can destroy it[N]in an instant.[FIN][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3][DLY:2]Erik: Do you think[N]Seth's really gone?[FIN][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2][DLY:2]Lilly: Maybe forgetting[N]some pain is one of the[N]ways people survive.[END]`
fr39_lance.dialogstring_05CA69! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: It's weird[N]thinkin' back to when I[N]couldn't remember things.[WAI][N]Good to know who ya all[N]are again![FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Lance! You've got[N]your memory back[AD]![FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Geez! You know, we[N]were worried about you!![FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: I had no idea what[N]was going to happen[AD][END]`
fr39_lance.dialogstring_05CAEC! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: Guess I worried[N]everyone.[WAI][N]If any of ya ever end[N]up like that, I'll be[N]the one looking after[N]ya next time.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'fr39_kara'
fr39_kara.dialogstring_05C597! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: I'm crying[AD] I don't[N]know why.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'fr39_lily'
fr39_lily.dialogstring_05C74D! `[CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: You go through so[N]much on a journey[AD][END]`

?INCLUDE 'fr39_erik'
fr39_erik.dialogstring_05CBF7! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: I heard there's a[N]weird inventor living in[N]the forest nearby.[WAI][N]His name is Neil.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: Neil?![FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]My cousin Neil went[N]missing.[WAI][N]He's an inventor too. He[N]even built a machine[N]called an aeroplane, meant[N]to fly like a bird.[FIN][CLD][DEF]The party heads into the[N]forest to meet the[N]inventor.[END]`
